<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">Settlement Rejected</h1>

<p>Hi {{merchantName}},</p>

<p>
  We are sorry — your settlement <strong>{{settlementId}}</strong> was rejected
  by our settlement team and has not been paid out.
</p>

<table style="margin:16px 0;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Settlement ID</td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>{{settlementId}}</strong></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Net amount</td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;">${{netAmountUsd}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if rejectionReason}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666;">Reason</td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;">{{rejectionReason}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>

<p>
  If you believe this was a mistake, reply to this email and our settlement
  team will review the case.
</p>

<p>— The DupDub Settlement Team</p>
